Spec: Backend actual identity test fixture

Purpose:
  Generate independent test devices and current server authority without exporting private keys.

Owns:
  ./fixture.go

Must:
  Use standard P-256/x509 TLS identities generated in process, temporary synchronized databases and isolated loopback sockets.
  Expose only test fixture helpers to tests; production backend components must not depend on this package.
  Preserve device/application role boundaries and close all fixture sockets, controls and databases in cleanup.
